SAANCHE (drawings you may use with their parameters; manifest excerpt):
- accountCard (center): a titled account/summary card with an amount · p = {w:number, color:color, title:text, amount:text}
- bank (bottom): a bank building with columns, optionally labelled · p = {w:number, label:text}
- bowl (bottom): a small bowl · p = {w:number}
- bugs (center): scattered grain bugs (spoilage) · p = {w:number, n:int}
- calendar (center): a wall calendar with a heading · p = {w:number, text:text}
- centralBank (bottom): a central bank building (columns, a coin in the pediment, a vault door), with a name plate; no emblem · p = {w:number, label:text}
- charpai (bottom): a woven charpai (rope cot) · p = {w:number}
- cheque (center): a bank cheque, optionally with an amount · p = {w:number, amount:text}
- clothRoll (center): a rolled bolt of cloth · p = {w:number, color:color}
- clothStack (bottom): folded cloths stacked in four colours · p = {w:number}
- coin (center): one coin in gold, silver or copper · p = {r:number, metal:choice[gold|silver|copper]}
- coinStack (bottom): a stack of coins · p = {r:number, n:int, metal:choice[gold|silver|copper]}
- committee (bottom): a committee: generic members seated behind a table with a name plate (MPC, reform committees) · p = {w:number, n:int, name:text, sub:text, color:color}
- cowries (center): three cowrie shells · p = {w:number}
- crowd (bottom): a crowd of small people in rows; a share from the left can be shaded and labelled, the rest coloured or dimmed (who is reached, who is left out) · p = {w:number, n:int, cols:int, share:number, shareColor:color, shareLabel:text, restColor:color, restLabel:text, label:text, dimRest:bool}
- disc (center): a coloured disc with a short word or number (RISK, 4%, FIXED) that can sit on and move between things · p = {w:number, text:text, color:color}
- goldBar (bottom): a 24K gold bar · p = {w:number}
- heap (bottom): a heap of salt or grain, dry or rain-wet · p = {w:number, kind:choice[salt|grain], wet:bool}
- institutionBadge (center): a round badge naming an institution (central bank, bank, government, regulator, international body, cooperative, committee, market, company); BIE's stand-in for every logo or emblem · p = {w:number, name:text, sub:text, kind:choice[central_bank|bank|government|regulator|international|cooperative|committee|market|company], color:color}
- mark (center): a judgement mark: tick, cross, question or circle · p = {w:number, kind:choice[tick|cross|question|circle], color:color}
- matka (bottom): an earthen pot · p = {w:number}
- moneyBag (bottom): a tied money bag whose size carries the meaning (tiny to huge), optional label band · p = {w:number, label:text, sign:text, color:color}
- note (center): one currency note; the colour follows the value · p = {w:number, value:text}
- noteBundle (center): a banded bundle of notes · p = {w:number, value:text}
- oilTin (bottom): an oil tin labelled तेल · p = {w:number}
- paper (center): a document: law, bond, licence, contract, bill or report, with title, year, amount, footer note and an optional rubber stamp · p = {w:number, kind:choice[law|bond|licence|contract|bill|report], title:text, year:text, value:text, note:text, lines:int, stamp:text, stampColor:color}
- phone (center): a phone showing home, scan, paid or received · p = {w:number, screen:choice[home|scan|paid|received], amount:text}
- qrStand (bottom): a counter QR-code stand (यहाँ scan करें) · p = {w:number}
- sack (bottom): a tied grain sack, optionally labelled · p = {w:number, content:choice[wheat|salt], label:text}
- saltPacket (bottom): a retail salt packet labelled नमक · p = {w:number}
- saw (center): a hand saw · p = {w:number}
- sweat (center): sweat drops (effort, worry) · p = {w:number}
- teaBrick (bottom): a pressed tea brick, optionally cracked · p = {w:number, crack:bool}
- tobacco (center): tobacco leaves tied in a bunch · p = {w:number}
- vault (bottom): a safe or vault holding note bundles: fill share, door open or closed, padlock, plate label and hanging tag (reserves kept aside, CRR, SLR, forex) · p = {w:number, label:text, fill:number, door:number, locked:bool, tag:text, tagColor:color, metal:choice[gold|steel]}
- veg (center): two vegetables (brinjal and tomato) · p = {w:number}
- wheat (center): wheat stalks with grain heads · p = {w:number}

